summary: The recent panel type

!! Commands

* ``recent:find`` — Recent: jump to a metarecord by name
* ``recent:first`` — Recent: jump to the most recent
* ``recent:last`` — Recent: jump to the oldest
* ``recent:next`` — Recent: move down
* ``recent:open`` — Recent: open the highlighted metarecord (here / other / new)
* ``recent:prev`` — Recent: move up
* ``recent:refresh`` — Recent: reload the list
